## PAYLOAD
Self-Maintaining APIs
> Concept: An automated background agent system that monitors third-party API changes and updates dependent codebases automatically.

> Core Problem: Breaking changes from external API vendors (e.g., Stripe, Twilio) consume significant engineering hours to identify, migrate, and test across company repositories.

> Solution: Scan vendor changelogs, open-source API documentation, and OpenAPI specifications continuously. The system automatically inspects your codebase and opens pull requests (PRs) that fix broken dependencies, complete with passing test suites and migration references.


